OL,3,AJeffrey Donaldson victim describes
OL,4,A'profound impact' of child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victims of child sex offender
OL,7,FJeffrey Donaldson have described the
OL,8,Fimpact the abuse had on them.
OL,10,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,11,Fcounts of sex abuse including one of
OL,12,Frape, which he committed against two
OL,13,Fwomen when they were children.
OL,15,FThe former Democratic Unionist Party
OL,16,F(DUP) leader appeared at Newry Crown
OL,17,FCourt for a hearing prior to his
OL,18,Fsentencing in October. He is seeking to
OL,19,Fappeal his convictions.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
