OL,3,AJeffrey Donaldson victim describes
OL,4,A'profound impact' of child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prosecution barrister told the
OL,7,Fcourt that one of the women said her
OL,8,Fchildhood had been stolen, while the
OL,9,Fsecond said the abuse affected her
OL,10,Fevery day.
